      "Part I — The Core Philosophy\n1. The first question: Why can't I do more?\nWhen progress slows, the instinctive response is often to change something:\n- Find a different strategy.\n- Try another platform.\n- Rewrite the plan.\n- Buy another tool.\n- Switch to a new goal.\n- Search for a shortcut.\nBefore doing that, ask a more useful question:",
