      "2. More, better, new: Use the right lever in the right order\nA useful way to think about progress is through three possible levers:\n- More: Increase the volume of an activity.\n- Better: Improve the quality or effectiveness of the activity.\n- New: Introduce a different approach, channel, offer, or method.\nAll three can matter. The mistake is treating “new” as the automatic answer whenever progress becomes uncomfortable.",
