      "Both perspectives are useful. They answer different questions.\nRelative return versus absolute output\nConsider a simplified marketing example:\n| Spend | Revenue generated | Revenue minus spend |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $100 | $1,000 | $900 |\n| $200 | $1,200 | $1,000 |",
