      "Ask both:\n- How can I improve the efficiency of this process?\n- How can I increase the total amount of valuable input flowing through it?\nA person can spend months improving a small part of a system while ignoring the much larger constraint.\nExercise: Reverse-engineer the goal\nWrite your target at the top of a page.",
