      "The solution may be batching, templates, delegation, better tools, or removing unnecessary steps.\nScale the inputs with the ambition\nIf the target requires more output, ask what needs to scale:\n- Your available hours.\n- Your skill.\n- Your equipment or tools.\n- Your team or collaborators.\n- Your production pipeline.\n- Your distribution capacity.\n- Your ability to review quality.\nDo not assume the current system can produce an outcome it was never designed to support."
